      "text": "Since $5x^2+21x+v$ is known to have the real root of $\\frac{-21-\\sqrt{301}}{10}$,\nthen the discriminant of $5x^2+21x+v=x^2+21x+v$\n$5^2-4\\times1\\times v$\n$25-4v=441$\n$25-441=4v$\n$-416=4v$\n$v=\\frac{-416}{4}$\n$v=-104$\nSo, the root is $\\boxed{-104}$.",
